#
# IRIS OHYAMA CL-RN2 LED Ceiling Light
# Protocol: Custom PWM, 38 kHz carrier, 33% duty cycle
# Frame: 40 bits (5 bytes): C0 [channel] [cmd1] [cmd2] [checksum]
#   Byte 0: 0xC0 (fixed prefix)
#   Byte 1: 0x81 = CH1, 0x80 = CH2
#   Byte 2-3: Command word
#   Byte 4: Checksum = byte2 ^ byte3 ^ byte1 ^ 0x9A
# Timing (us): Header 2000/1100 + 5550/1130, Bit1 1460/580, Bit0 440/580, Stop 440
#
